This package redistributes the request rule files (REQUEST-9xx-*.conf) and
the data files they read from the OWASP CRS source release named by the rule
files' "ver:" tags, unmodified. cdnca selects rules, paranoia levels and
anomaly thresholds in its own generated configuration (CRS profile packs
system/crs-*), not by editing these files.
